      "side": 1,
      "message": "Add a macro for this new priority level.  Something like:\n\n#define KERNEL_INIT_NPCX_PRIORITY (CONFIG_KERNEL_INIT_PRIORITY_OBJECTS - 10)\n#if (KERNEL_INIT_PRIORITY_NPCX_CORE \u003c\u003d 0)\n#error \"CONFIG_KERNEL_INIT_PRIORITY_OBJECTS must be 10 or greater\"\n#endif\n\nThen use (KERNEL_INIT_PRIORITY_NPCX_CORE + 1) here and KERNEL_INIT_PRIORITY_NPCX_CORE in cros_system_npcx_init().",
