      "writtenOn": "2021-03-15T09:42:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Zephyr priority couldn\u0027t use symbolic expressions. It direct stringifies the priority to generate the linker symbol. Use \u0027CONFIG_KERNEL_INIT_PRIORITY_OBJECTS - 10\u0027 will generate the following symbol \u0027.init_PRE_KERNEL_130-10 \u0027 which priority is lower than CONFIG_KERNEL_INIT_PRIORITY_OBJECTS. How about adding a preprocessor utility to calculate the priority(CL.2759764) \u0026 define following:\n```\n#define CROS_SYSTEM_NPCX_INIT_PRIORITY \\\n\tSUB(CONFIG_KERNEL_INIT_PRIORITY_OBJECTS, 10)\n\n#define CROS_BBRAM_NPCX_INIT_PRIORITY ADD(CROS_SYSTEM_NPCX_INIT_PRIORITY, 1)\n```\n or just define it without symbolic expressions \u0026 add a guard to check dependency?",
      "parentUuid": "b6a2d64a_5bdff5e8",
